<title>USA: DuPont Co ups quarterly to $0.63 shr.</title>
<headline>DuPont Co ups quarterly to $0.63 shr.</headline>
<dateline>WILMINGTON, Del. 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarterly</p>
<p>				Latest	 Prior</p>
<p>Amount		     $ 0.63	 $ 0.57</p>
<p>Pay			  June 12</p>
<p>Record		     May 15</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's shareholders approved an increase in number authorized shares on April 30. The company's common stock will be split two for one, with one additional share being distributed on June 12 for each share of common stock held of record on May 15. The latest dividend was declared on a pre-split basis.</p>
</text>
